document.write('<object width=\"384\" height=\"356\" classid=\"clsid:D27CDB6E-AE6D-11cf-96B8-444553540000\" id=\"ep\"><param name=\"allowfullscreen\" value=\"true\" /><param name=\"allowscriptaccess\" value=\"always\" /><param name=\"wmode\" value=\"transparent\" /><param name=\"movie\" value=\"http://i.cdn.turner.com/money/.element/apps/cvp/4.0/swf/cnn_money_384x216_embed.swf?context=embed&videoId=/video/fortune/2010/05/26/f_tm_zuckerberg_facebook_privacy.fortune\" /><param name=\"bgcolor\" value=\"#000000\" /><embed src=\"http://i.cdn.turner.com/money/.element/apps/cvp/4.0/swf/cnn_money_384x216_embed.swf?context=embed&videoId=/video/fortune/2010/05/26/f_tm_zuckerberg_facebook_privacy.fortune\" type=\"application/x-shockwave-flash\" bgcolor=\"#000000\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" allowscriptaccess=\"always\" width=\"384\" wmode=\"transparent\" height=\"356\"></embed></object> <p>Facebook CEO Mark Zuckerberg talks to Jon Fortt about how he has tried to simplify the social network\'s privacy settings and mollify critics.</p> <p><span style=\"color:#ffffff;\">(AAPL) (MSFT) (GOOG) (YHOO)</span></p> <span class=\"fdPrintIncludeParentsPreviousSiblings\"></span><span class=\"fdPrintIncludeParentsChildren\"></span><br />Filed under: <a href=\'http://tech.fortune.cnn.com/category/techmate/big-tech/\'>Big Tech</a>, <a href=\'http://tech.fortune.cnn.com/category/techmate/\'>Techmate</a>, <a href=\'http://tech.fortune.cnn.com/category/video/\'>Video</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/gocomments/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/27034/\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/comments/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/27034/\" /></a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/godelicious/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/27034/\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/delicious/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/27034/\" /></a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/gofacebook/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/27034/\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/facebook/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/27034/\" /></a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/gotwitter/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/27034/\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/twitter/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/27034/\" /></a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/gostumble/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/27034/\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/stumble/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/27034/\" /></a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/godigg/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/27034/\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/digg/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/27034/\" /></a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/goreddit/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/27034/\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/reddit/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/27034/\" /></a> <img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://stats.wordpress.com/b.gif?host=tech.fortune.cnn.com&amp;blog=8466345&amp;post=27034&amp;subd=fortunebrainstormtech&amp;ref=&amp;feed=1\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" />');
