document.write('<p>In this episode of Techmate, <a href=\"http://tech.fortune.cnn.com/2010/04/29/hp-strategy-chief-shane-robison-on-palm-buy/\" target=\"_blank\">Jon</a> and <a href=\"http://tech.fortune.cnn.com/2010/04/21/the-ultimate-personal-technology/\" target=\"_blank\">Michael</a> explain why despite its large market share Research in Motion (<a href=\"http://money.cnn.com/quote/quote.html?symb=RIMM\" target=\"_blank\">RIMM</a>) and its iconic BlackBerry may be threatened by the touchscreen revolution. With Apple\'s (<a href=\"http://money.cnn.com/quote/quote.html?symb=AAPL\" target=\"_blank\">AAPL</a>) iPhone becoming evermore popular and Google\'s (<a href=\"http://money.cnn.com/quote/quote.html?symb=GOOG\" target=\"_blank\">GOOG</a>) Android OS quickly gaining steam, the Techmates wonder if smart-phone keyboards will  soon be extinct. Plus, as an added bonus, find out why Michael is now smitten with his Nexus One phone.</p> <object width=\"384\" height=\"356\" classid=\"clsid:D27CDB6E-AE6D-11cf-96B8-444553540000\" id=\"ep\"><param name=\"allowfullscreen\" value=\"true\" /><param name=\"allowscriptaccess\" value=\"always\" /><param name=\"wmode\" value=\"transparent\" /><param name=\"movie\" value=\"http://i.cdn.turner.com/money/.element/apps/cvp/4.0/swf/cnn_money_384x216_embed.swf?context=embed&videoId=/video/technology/2010/04/29/tm_blackberry_iphone_android.fortune\" /><param name=\"bgcolor\" value=\"#000000\" /><embed src=\"http://i.cdn.turner.com/money/.element/apps/cvp/4.0/swf/cnn_money_384x216_embed.swf?context=embed&videoId=/video/technology/2010/04/29/tm_blackberry_iphone_android.fortune\" type=\"application/x-shockwave-flash\" bgcolor=\"#000000\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" allowscriptaccess=\"always\" width=\"384\" wmode=\"transparent\" height=\"356\"></embed></object> <span class=\"fdPrintIncludeParentsPreviousSiblings\"></span><span class=\"fdPrintIncludeParentsChildren\"></span><br />Filed under: <a href=\'http://tech.fortune.cnn.com/category/techmate/big-tech/\'>Big Tech</a>, <a href=\'http://tech.fortune.cnn.com/category/daily-brainstorm/\'>Daily Brainstorm</a>, <a href=\'http://tech.fortune.cnn.com/category/techmate/\'>Techmate</a>, <a href=\'http://tech.fortune.cnn.com/category/video/\'>Video</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/gocomments/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/24398/\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/comments/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/24398/\" /></a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/godelicious/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/24398/\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/delicious/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/24398/\" /></a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/gofacebook/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/24398/\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/facebook/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/24398/\" /></a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/gotwitter/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/24398/\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/twitter/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/24398/\" /></a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/gostumble/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/24398/\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/stumble/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/24398/\" /></a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/godigg/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/24398/\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/digg/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/24398/\" /></a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/goreddit/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/24398/\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://feeds.wordpress.com/1.0/reddit/fortunebrainstormtech.wordpress.com/24398/\" /></a> <img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://stats.wordpress.com/b.gif?host=tech.fortune.cnn.com&amp;blog=8466345&amp;post=24398&amp;subd=fortunebrainstormtech&amp;ref=&amp;feed=1\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" />');
